            hope.
        </p>
        <p>
            Inspired by the techno-utopianism of the 1990s, the project aims to provide a modern computing environment
            that is fiscally sustainable, with clear pricing and transparent margins,
            because when you use your computer, <em>you</em> shouldn't be the product. Software should be respectful of
            the humans who interact with it.
        </p>
